  "material": {
    "law": "W=chi*[mu*(tr(F^T F)-4)/2 -mu*log(det F) + lambda*(det F-1)^2/2], det F>0; energy extended to +infinity at nonpositive determinant",
    "values": "mu=K=1, lambda=K-mu/2, reference transverse inertia at full order 1. At chi=0 lattice has no stress or wave inertia; carrier energy remains separate.",
    "rank_one_check": "At F+h a tensor b, W_second/chi=mu*|a|^2 |b|^2+[mu/J^2+lambda]*(cof(F):(a tensor b))^2. The determinant is affine on rank-one lines. Convex dependence on independent variables F and J establishes polyconvexity. At small strain the tangent is 2mu dev(e)+K tr(e) I.",
    "bulk_curve": "p/chi=mu/J-mu/sqrt(J)-lambda*(J-1), bulk tangent/chi=mu/J-mu/(2sqrt(J))+lambda*J. Positive at these moduli for all J>0.",
